cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "JORO-HPC: Validated Multiscale LPDM-ABM Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Multiscale mechanistic simulator of the invasion of Trichonephila clavata (Joro spider)
  in North America. It couples a 3D Lagrangian particle dispersion model driven by seasonal
  May-July ERA5 reanalysis in FP16 (SYCL, Intel Arc GPU) and a road-weighted human gravity
  dispersal kernel with a physiologically structured agent-based demographic model (OpenMP,
  AVX-512) and a non-stationary citizen-science observation process on a 5 km equal-area
  grid (EPSG:5070, PostGIS), with multi-start simulated-annealing calibration (2014-2019)
  and frozen blind out-of-sample validation (2020-2024).
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
